OL,3,AFour in hospital after Bromley stabbing
OL,4,
OL,5,FFour people have been taken to hospital
OL,6,Ffollowing a stabbing in Bromley High
OL,7,FStreet, London Ambulance Service has
OL,8,Fconfirmed.
OL,10,FParamedics attended alongside the
OL,11,FLondon Air Ambulance at 14:19 BST on
OL,12,FThursday.
OL,14,FThe high street is currently closed
OL,15,Fboth ways from Ringers Road to
OL,16,FEthelbert Road.
OL,18,FPhotos posted on X on Thursday
OL,19,Fafternoon appeared to show part of
OL,20,FBromley High Street cordoned off by
OL,21,Fpolice, with emergency vehicles at the
OL,22,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
